<p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">XUZHOU BAILIXING WOOD INDUSTRY CO., LTD.</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">Established in 1998, BLXING is strategically situated in Guanhu Town, Pizhou City, Jiangsu Province. Our company covers an extensive area of 60,000 square meters, with a production workshop spanning 30,000 square meters. We pride ourselves on possessing advanced production equipment and a professional team composed of excellent managers and proficient technical staff. As a frontrunner in the design, production, and marketing of formwork system products across China.<br/>&nbsp;Our product portfolio mainly features Film Faced Plywood, Commercial plywood, Block board, MDF, LVL, Chipboards, Melamine boards, etc. These products enjoy robust sales in the Middle East, South America, Europe, Africa, and Southeast Asia. All items are meticulously processed in-house by our efficient and cohesive workforce. In pursuit of meeting diverse customer demands,we are fostering an enterprising spirit that emphasizes innovation and adheres to high-quality standards. Sincerely, we aspire to become your trustworthy business partner and look forward with anticipation to receiving your valuable suggestions and inquiries. Please do not hesitate to get in touch with us. You are also warmly welcome to visit our factory at any time.</span></p>

